WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.336
[music playing]

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.109
- Oh God, my body is trembling.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.377
Oh my God.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.915
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.183
- Look up here, B.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.019
- No, I'm just
looking right here.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.756
- What are you thinking right
now flying through the air?

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:25.392
- I'm just holding on man.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.694
I should probably be grateful
that they're hauling me out

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.964
on a wench, instead of making
me pull myself by hand,

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.098
but I'm not.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.100
I'm just plain terrified.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.235
- You're almost to me, look.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.202
- I hear your voice.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:37.303
I can't-- I can't look up.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.805
- You're right here buddy.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.106
Little bit more,
little bit more.

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.808
Right there, let's
stop right there.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.176
[bird cawing]

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.511
- That wasn't so bad, right?

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.812
- Yes it was.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.815
I'm ready to clean, so I can
get the crap out of here.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.584
- You look great, we're going
to get this done, brother.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:52.819
- OK.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.154
I'm so emotionally attached
to you right now, Mike.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.288
[laughing]

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:56.589
- Mike only gave
me an hour to get

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.158
out here, clean the
Skywalk's glass floor,

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.026
and get back on land.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.795
Time to put my
training into motion,

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.898
even though all I want to do
is get back on solid ground.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:05.932
- Go up?

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.367
- Yeah, start to ascending up.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:08.868
- There's a lot
of trust involved.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:12.405
I have to trust Mike, I have
to trust all the equipment

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.708
that I'm wearing, I have to
trust the training that I did,

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.010
and the hardest thing--

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.279
Whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa
whoa whoa whoa whoa.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.480
I have to trust me.

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.916
And somehow push
myself up to the glass.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.884
- Atta boy

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.119
- What is that on my foot?

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:29.289
- You're touching me, that's me.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.291
- I Can't get my grip up.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.860
- Use your knee, put up
against that structure.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:37.564
Nice Go and start cleaning
Bobby whenever you're ready,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.465
time is ticking.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.799
[grunting]

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.735
- The one thing we never
practiced, only holding

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.971
on to the rope with
one arm, while cleaning

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:47.707
the glass with the other.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.943
I guess I didn't realize
there would be a tourist

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.211
here while I was cleaning it.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.813
Hello, folks I'm the
idiot underneath.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.849
Tell everybody you saw
Bobby Bones cleaning

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:56.950
the bottom of the Skywalk.

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.818
Tell one, tell all.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:01.454
- Now the trick is you got to
get all the way to the back.

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:03.089
You got that far
corner to get to.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.591
So we got to get
on those toes, man.

00:02:04.657 --> 00:02:07.026
You're relying too much on
the structure and your legs.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.662
Reach out boom, reach out boom.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:10.997
OK, I need you do that.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.732
It's tricky, isn't it?

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.701
- Yeah.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.970
- That a boy, there you go.

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.505
Reach out there.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.206
Focus on the glass, don't
worry about what's under you.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.407
[music playing]

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:27.614
- All right, I feel like
I got my first panel done.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.649
- All right, now let's
get that second panel done

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.184
and we can get the
hell out of here.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:32.952
- All right, the key is
to reach right, Mike?

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:34.120
- Key is to reach.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.021
To try to get on
those toes, brother.

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:36.356
Try to use those toes.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:37.690
Want to try to get that
whole body stretched.

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:40.527
[music playing]

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:44.330
- Doing great, man.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:45.665
You're doing great.

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:47.600
- One more spot and I'll
have feel like I got it.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.570
- All right, and after
that, brother it's home.

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:51.538
Homeward bound.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.139
[grunting]

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:54.641
- I got it.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:55.575
Oh my God.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.277
I'm finally done
with the cleaning.

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.546
But I'd forgotten about
the scariest part of all,

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:02.048
descending back down the
rope and transferring

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:03.449
to another line.

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:05.218
- Open up that faceplate
and I could see perfectly

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:06.185
what you're doing, man.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.856
[music playing]

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.661
Nice and easy start to descend.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:18.197
Pull the handle, grab the brake
strand like I thought you.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.199
Pull the handle and
you'll start to drop.

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:21.701
That a boy!

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:22.702
- Oh my God.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:23.836
- Nice and easy.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.038
Start to come down.

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:26.306
Come on down.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.540
- Is there any chance
this thing drops?

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:28.241
Oh my God.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:29.208
- You just-- no come on.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:30.476
- Oh my God.

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:31.311
- Come on, yeah.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:32.545
Just hold it right there.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.780
What I'm gonna do
I'm going to re-hook

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:34.948
you onto your lowering system.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.549
give me some slack.

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:40.620
- I just want to get back
to the land, honestly.

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.221
OK, transfer complete.

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:44.791
I'm still alive, but
the wench moves slow

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:46.659
and I know time is running out.

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.661
- All right B, see
you on the cliff side.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:49.662
- I can't freaking wait.

00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:51.097
- Bye Bobby.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.900
- Bye.

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:55.034
Oh my God.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:58.071
- Great freaking job, dude.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.540
- Earth I love you.

00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:04.544
I cannot wait to be on you again
and continue our relationship.

00:04:04.611 --> 00:04:07.213
- All right, I'm going to come
out and receive you, all right?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.282
[music playing]

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:11.918
- All right, come on in.

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.086
- Oh my God,

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:14.020
- All good.

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.188
[grunting]

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:16.756
- All right, Bobby!

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:17.924
- I'm not there yet.

00:04:17.991 --> 00:04:19.726
- You're there
buddy, you're there.

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:20.660
- Proud of you Bobby.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.495
[sighing]

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:26.165
- So how you feeling?

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:30.003
- Mentally exhausted,
emotionally fatigued,

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:32.238
and my body is whooped.

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:34.607
I see how you guys,
you do this all day

00:04:34.674 --> 00:04:36.676
and it's like you really
need some downtime.

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.711
I mean, this is the
most grueling thing

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.146
I have ever done.

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:41.814
Also the scariest thing
I've ever done ever,

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.883
and I've done some pretty
freaking scary stuff.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:47.086
And I just appreciate you guys,
Mike appreciate you, the team.

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:48.955
I'm very excited
about unhooking myself

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:50.990
and getting on full land.

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:51.991
- Right on Bobby, man.

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:53.259
I'm super proud of you dude.

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:55.261
You overcame your
fears, you got it done.

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:56.629
Looks like a pass, buddy.

00:04:56.696 --> 00:04:57.764
Super good job man.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:02.168
[music playing]

